==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Unseen Forces|Spinarak|75}} from the {{TCG|EX Unseen Forces}} expansion; both cards have the '''Pierce''' attack.
*'''Pierce''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Kabuto|39}} and {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Anorith|27}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

